#!/usr/bin/env python3
# cx - build, run, and inspect the Centrallix dev server for this checkout.
#
# Each checkout (main or git worktree) gets its own install prefix in
# <checkout>/.cx, its own config, and its own HTTP port, so several checkouts
# can each run a server on one machine. Nothing here needs root.
#
# Built for AI agents as well as people: every action is one of a fixed set,
# no shell is ever invoked, credentials never reach argv or output, and fetch
# can only reach this checkout's server on localhost.

